:: MP Moment Park 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
公园中心白石喷泉的西侧狮头出水口被几枚生锈铜币与落叶堵住，水柱歪斜地往长椅方向乱溅。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回公园步道 (0:02)|Park]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-park-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "用细枝挑出铜币 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-park-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	喷泉水柱恢复了优美的弧线，你还从槽缝里一并抠出了几枚亮闪闪的银币。<span class="green">你疏通了喷泉并收获了池底银币。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_park_2")>><<money 260>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向避风长椅凉亭 (0:03)|MP Moment Park 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	水柱突然喷涌而出，冰凉的水花溅湿了你的前襟。<span class="red">飞溅的泉水打湿了你的衣襟。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Park 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|Park]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "踩上池沿清走排水槽的落叶 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-park-2">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
		你稳稳踩上白石喷泉池沿，伸手将卡在狮头出水口排水槽里的湿落叶与生锈铜币一把掏净。<span class="green">银亮水柱重新高高涌起，掏出的几枚许愿古铜徽章也落入你口袋。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_park_2")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[走向避风长椅凉亭 (0:03)|Park]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
		白石池沿被喷泉水雾浸得湿滑，你探身掏落叶时鞋底滑了半寸，掌心在石雕边擦出一道红印。<span class="red">你连忙收回重心跳下池沿，先擦干手心水渍。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Park 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|Park]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Park 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
公园凉亭的长椅下遗落着一只牛皮速写画夹，微风吹开搭扣，几张炭笔风景画眼看就要飞进灌木丛。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回公园步道 (0:02)|Park]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-park-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "快步上前收拢吹散的速写纸 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-park-3">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	匆匆折返找画夹的美术生千恩万谢，硬把买画材剩下的零钱塞进你手里。<span class="green">你将散落的画稿完璧归赵。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_park_3")>><<money 240>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走到旧玻璃花房外侧 (0:03)|MP Moment Park 4]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	钻进灌木丛捡画纸时，带刺的冬青枝刮破了你的手背。<span class="red">冬青刺在手背上划出了红痕。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[收敛呼吸节奏再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Park 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|Park]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "按页码将画稿归位 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-park-3">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
		你将捡回的炭笔速写稿按右下角的铅笔页码逐张排好，夹进牛皮画夹内层并扣紧黄铜搭扣。<span class="green">折返寻画的美术生见画稿一页不少且顺序井然，感激地塞给你一笔谢礼。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_park_3")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[走到旧玻璃花房外侧 (0:03)|Park]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
		林荫间的阳光透过树叶晃花了眼，几张未标页码的草图一时难以分辨先后次序。<span class="red">你揉了揉发涩的眼角，决定坐到凉亭长椅上慢慢比对。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[挽起袖口稳稳再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Park 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
