<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "踩上花坛石沿收拢缠绕棉线 (0:10)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-park-4">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
		你踩上花坛石沿顺着风向一圈圈收拢棉线，挂在尖顶的风筝顺势滑落进你手里。<span class="green">风筝完好无损，线轴下还压着一枚祈福币。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_park_4")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><</if>>
